title: Constitutional Reforms
subtitle: Our trademark reforms are to be decided now...
view-if: year = 1952 and month = 3 and spd_in_government = 1
max-visits: 1
tags: event
face-image: img/All_Quiet.jpg
go-to: constitute

@constitute

= Constitutional Reforms

We will now decide our Amendments for the constitution. We have already agreed that Presidential Vetoes will be limited and the Legislative Powers of the Supreme Court will be removed.

- @constitute_menu: The List of reforms
- @end_amendments: Finish the draft of the constitution.

@constitute_menu

- @threshold: Reduce the electoral threshold to 5%.
- @nothreshold: Remove the amendment from the threshold.
- @term: Have the number of terms a president can serve be limited to 3.
- @noterm: Have the President serve unlimited terms.
- @minister: Have the appointing of ministers require a confidence vote.
- @nominister: Ministers require no confidence votes
- @decree: Have decrees require an enabling act.
- @nodecree: Keep Decrees as is.
- @moh: Remove the Member of Honour position.
- @nomoh: Keep the Member of Honour status.
- @impeach: Have the impeachment of the President require both the Supreme Court and Assembly 
- @noimpeach: Keep the current of law of impeachment only requiring the Supreme Court
- @return: Return...

@threshold
view-if: threshold_reform <= 0
on-arrival: threshold_reform = 1; reform_number += 1;
go-to: constitute_menu

@nothreshold
view-if: threshold_reform >= 1
on-arrival: threshold_reform = 0; reform_number -= 1;
go-to: constitute_menu

@term
view-if: term_reform <= 0
on-arrival: term_reform = 1; reform_number += 1;
go-to: constitute_menu

@noterm
view-if: term_reform >= 1
on-arrival: term_reform = 0; reform_number -= 1;
go-to: constitute_menu


@minister
view-if: minister_reform <= 0
on-arrival: threshold_reform = 1; reform_number += 1;
go-to: constitute_menu

@nominister
view-if: minister_reform >= 1
on-arrival: minister_reform = 0; reform_number -= 1;
go-to: constitute_menu

@decree
view-if: decree_reform <= 0
on-arrival: decree_reform = 1; reform_number += 1;
go-to: constitute_menu

@nodecree
view-if: decree_reform >= 1
on-arrival: decree_reform = 0; reform_number -= 1;
go-to: constitute_menu

@moh
view-if: moh_reform <= 0
on-arrival: moh_reform = 1; reform_number += 1;
go-to: constitute_menu

@nomoh
view-if: moh_reform >= 1
on-arrival: moh_reform = 0; reform_number -= 1;
go-to: constitute_menu

@impeach
view-if: impeachment_reform <= 0
on-arrival: impeachment_reform = 1; reform_number += 1;
go-to: constitute_menu

@noimpeach
view-if: impeachment_reform >= 1
on-arrival: impeachment_reform = 0; reform_number -= 1;
go-to: constitute_menu


@return
go-to: constitute

@end_amendments
on-departure: lib_dissent += 15 if reforms_number >= 4; socdem_dissent += 15 if reforms_number >= 4; cap_dissent += 15 if reforms_number >= 4; usp_relation -= 10 if moh_reform = 1; veto_reform = 1; judge_reform = 1; reform_number += 2

We have finalized the draft for our constitution. [? if reform_number >= 4: Our party delegates are upset at our watered down reforms ?] [? if moh_reform = 1 : Many USP MPs are not willing to vote to remove the Member of Honor title. ?]
